  "content": "<p><strong>InsaneCraft v1.3.1 是官方 InsaneCraft 整合包的最后一次更新。我们将不再提供后续更新或错误修复，并且<u>停止对 InsaneCraft 的技术支持</u>。感谢您一直以来对该整合包的关注与对系列内容的喜爱！&lt;3<br><br>由以下主播实况游玩：SSundee、Sigils、Henwy、BiffleWiffle 和 JeromeASF。</strong></p><p>+ 包含 250 个疯狂模组<br>+ 内含 Lost Infinity 模组&nbsp;<br>+ 官方整合包<br>+ 经典与全新模组兼备<br>+ 免费世界托管服务！（需安装 Essential 模组）</p><p>终极挑战：收集无限宝石，成为灭霸。</p><p>推荐内存配置：<br>- 6GB（基础）<br>- 8GB（推荐）<br>- 16GB（最佳）</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/527180/description_e4cb3795-16f6-4bad-a2a2-408e3ae8caf4.jpg\"><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/suENVN_n3rw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></em></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8gLD6S73riI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p>模组列表（点击名称访问模组页面）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">交错次元（MrCompost）<br></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊国度（Shinoow）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊国度整合（Shinoow）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alchemistry\" rel=\"nofollow\">炼金化学（al132）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">环境音效4（CreativeMD）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-spellcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">古代法术（windanesz）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/base\" rel=\"nofollow\">B.A.S.E（lanse505）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bad-wither-no-cookie-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">凋灵优化重制版（Kreezxil）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bewitchment-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">巫术学-传承版（sunconure11）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法（Vazkii）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brandons-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">布兰登核心（brandon3055）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buildcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">建筑（Covert_Jaguar）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carry-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">搬运（Tschipp）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/champions\" rel=\"nofollow\">冠军（TheIllusiveC4）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunkpregenerator\" rel=\"nofollow\">区块预生成（Speiger）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">珊瑚墓碑（Corail_31）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成调整（Jaredlll08）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">创意核心（CreativeMD）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" rel=\"nofollow\">循环（Lothrazar）</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionaldoors\" rel=\"nofollow\">维度门（DimensionalDevelopment）</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/